# SharpMUSH's own site settings, run as God after the import (the world itself comes from setup.mush).
# With no messages_object, SharpMUSH shows the stored texts of its messages (SharpMUSH.Library/Messages/*.txt),
# as PennMUSH shows its txt/ files, and the site-text rule removes both from login steps.
@config/set messages_object=#-1
